:''Not to be confused with [[M. Ost]].''
'''Oldstrich''' (ダ・チョー老, ''Da・Chōrō'') is a [[:Category:Zombie Enemies|Zombie]]/[[:Category:Sage Enemies|Sage]] variant of [[R.Ost]] that appears in [[Zero Legends]]. He was added in [[Version 13.7 Update|Version 13.7]].

